  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 14 as printed (10 offices, 合計, 同上中 本邦人/韓國人/外國人). Columns: 31 occupation columns + 總計 + 明治三十八年度末, printed across p.228 (6 columns), p.229 (25 columns) and p.230 (總計, 明治三十八年度末, with the 種別 label column repeated). Places are the printed row labels; occupations the printed column heads.",
   "Row checks: for every row the 31 occupation cells add to the printed 總計 (all 14 rows reconcile, incl. 合計 2,361 and 本邦人 2,228 / 韓國人 101 / 外國人 32).",
   "Column checks: the 10 offices add to 合計 in every column (incl. 總計 2,361 and 明治三十八年度末 1,065). Nationality split (本邦人+韓國人+外國人) equals 合計 except: 醫藥業 87+0+0=87 vs 90; 奢侈品及學術技藝ニ關スル者 150+0+8=158 vs 159; 農作物販賣 103+3+0=106 vs 103; 林產物販賣 32+1+0=33 vs 32. Checked the 韓國人 row by eye: 3 is printed under 農作物販賣 and 1 under 林產物販賣 (dashes under 醫藥業 and 奢侈品); transcribed as printed.",
   "Stacked 一/二/三 strokes were grouped by their line spacing (each digit occupies one line). Cases: 京城 織物 一/三=13; 仁川 織物 一/二=12; 釜山 織物 二/二=22; 鎮南浦 交通業 二/一=21; 仁川 銀行 一/一=11; 馬山 旅宿 一/一=11; 鎮南浦 飲食品 一/一=11; 元山 旅宿 二/一=21; 京城 醫藥 一/一=11; 京城 不生產 一/二=12; 仁川 不生產 一/三=13; 仁川 雜 二/一=21; 永登浦 總計 一/一=11. All agree with the printed totals.",
   "總計 馬山: four strokes; spacing reads 一/一/二 = 112 (candidates 112 or 一三 = 13). 112 is the only candidate that reconciles with the 總計 column total 2,361 (the other cells read with confidence) — the 一/二/三 grouping was settled by the printed total.",
   "明治三十八年度末 本邦人/韓國人/外國人 are printed as dashes.",
   "'|' (vertical dash) written —."
